        "actual_behavior": "Native routing selects num_experts entries, but persistent fused buffers retain num_experts_per_tok entries. The first exl3_mgemm checks these dimensions for equality. The inspected direct MLP callers are the two decoder-block forward methods; the changed models use TransformerBlock. This conditional reach does not establish that ordinary generation or calibration triggers it.",
